# MNI OWNERS
#
# Format: <pattern> <@org/team> [required]
#
# Examples:
#   packages/foo/        @MNI-io/team-a            advisory reviewer recommendation
#   packages/foo/bar.ts  @MNI-io/team-b required   team approval blocks merge
#
# Last-match-wins: specific rules MUST come AFTER general rules.
#
# The `required` option makes team approval mandatory: a member of the team
# must approve the PR before merge. This is enforced by the
# "Required Reviews" commit status (ci-owners-required-reviews.yml).
# All other entries are advisory (reviewer recommendations and opt-in
# reviewer auto-assignment).
#
